# Member data exports and the import scripts built from them.
# The Breeze export carries ~580 people's emails, phones and birthdates. public/
# is served verbatim at the site root, so an export dropped there is downloadable
# by anyone with the URL; and git history is far harder to scrub than a file.
# Keep these locally, never commit them.
public/*.xlsx
public/*.csv
scripts/import-md-members-breeze-*.sql
